\subtree{
  \title{Decision}
  \p{Handwritten forest nodes preserve rationale, hypotheses, and unresolved questions. They transclude generated signatures rather than restating them. The current revision's Markdown is authoritative until it is ported; history is ported as history.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Rationale}
  \p{Documentation needs both machine-checked statements and their design context.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Rejected}
  \p{Treating generated statement text as a replacement for a decision's reasoning.}
}
\subtree{
